6
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:26,360
Their offices, dates, redemption rights,
priority rules, and claim forms can

7
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:31,340
differ. Even within one state, judicial
and nonjudicial processes may take

8
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:35,520
